    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000tadc](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000tadc) Magnitude 5.8 earthquake at 35.0 depth occurred on Jul 06 2026 48km S of Sarangani. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 4.9886 longitude 125.326. It impacted 26037 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
